        "function_name": "BSP_ShipMessage_SetEngineJamFailure_Construct",
        "comment": "[BSP reconstruction 007619b0]\nHypothesis, not a recovered symbol. Packet cc2_loose_ends_2, read-only analysis. __thiscall(msg), the message constructor for kind 6Ch MT_SHIP_SET_ENGINEJAMFAILURE. Stores msg+4h = 3, msg+8h = msg+Ch = 0, [msg] = 00D02C68 and msg+10h = 6Ch as a BYTE immediate at 007619C8 (C6 40 10 6C), then msg+14h = [[00E188A8] + side*4 + 18CCh] when the local side at [[00E188A8]+18ECh] is in 0..7, else 0. Because the kind is a byte store and never a PUSH into 0075B430, a scan of the kind pushed at each of the 426 0075B430 call sites misses it. Three callers: 00768FA6, 00813530 (FUN_008132C0's EngineJam branch) and 00827D65."
